Subject: Cantor M2B Supplied Entry Stability Reconciliation

Description: Canonical SJS authority for a zero-effect transform that independently validates caller-supplied pre-read and post-read entry batches, compares every admitted entry-local field in one closed order, and returns one inspectable stable pair or one typed fault without claiming physical time, origin, or sameness.

